messages.content:
Prepare six useful optional communication cards for the fictional person and activity below. Follow the supplied communication style and maximum words per card. Return only a JSON object with the key "cards" containing exactly six nonempty strings. Do not include commentary.


FICTIONAL CASE:
{"profile": {"name": "Dev", "age": 10, "communication_style": "short phrases"}, "activity": "Share a fictional story with a friend using pictures of a bus, a boat and a park.", "facts": ["Dev has said he enjoys stories about boats.", "No actual trip, birthday or family event has been described.", "A story can be invented, but it should not be presented as Dev’s actual memory.", "Dev can choose another story or stop."], "shared_context": "This is a fictional authoring exercise. The person’s full existing communication system stays available. These are optional supplemental phrase cards, not claims about current intent.", "word_limit": 8}

message.content:
{
  "cards": [
    "I am 10 years old, so I speak very short phrases.",
    "My name is Dev.",
    "I love telling stories about boats.",
    "I do not know my actual birthday.",
    "I can choose any story or stop anytime.",
    "I will share pictures of a bus, a boat, and a park."
  ]
}
